&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New interactive agent experience: running &lt;code&gt;ollama&lt;/code&gt; now launches an agent to help you code and delegate work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto&quot; data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=&quot;❯ ollama
Ollama 0.32.0

▸ Chat, Code, &amp;amp; Work (glm-5.2:cloud)
    Chat with models, code, search the web, and delegate real work&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;❯ ollama
Ollama 0.32.0

▸ Chat, Code, &amp;amp; Work (glm-5.2:cloud)
    Chat with models, code, search the web, and delegate real work
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renamed the Codex App integration to ChatGPT: use ollama launch chatgpt (and --restore to return to your usual ChatGPT profile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplified integration selection: the ollama launch menu now only offers the most popular integrations (other integrations can be accessed through &lt;code&gt;ollama launch&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Warns before launching older agent models: CodeLlama, Qwen2.5(-coder), Llama 3.x, Mistral, StarCoder, and the base DeepSeek-R1 tags now prompt a deprecation warning before ollama launch continues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full Changelog: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.31.2...v0.32.0&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.31.2...v0.32.0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;vLLM v0.25.0 Release Notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release features 558 commits from 232 contributors (64 new)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Runner V2 is now the default for all dense models&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4582973141&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44443&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44443/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44443&quot;&gt;#44443&lt;/a&gt;). Building on quantized-model support from the previous release, MRv2 is now the standard execution path, with new support for EVS (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4729200674&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46535&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46535/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46535&quot;&gt;#46535&lt;/a&gt;), realtime embeddings (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4746942694&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46762&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46762/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46762&quot;&gt;#46762&lt;/a&gt;), prefix caching for Mamba hybrid models (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4428155736&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/42406&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42406/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42406&quot;&gt;#42406&lt;/a&gt;), multimodal-prefix bidirectional attention (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4761265985&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46942&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46942/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46942&quot;&gt;#46942&lt;/a&gt;), and dynamic speculative decoding compatible with full CUDA graphs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4686202847&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45953&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45953/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45953&quot;&gt;#45953&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PagedAttention has been removed&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4790219382&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47361&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47361/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47361&quot;&gt;#47361&lt;/a&gt;). The legacy attention implementation is deleted now that V1/MRv2 backends are the standard path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Transformers modeling backend is now as fast as native vLLM&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4778942021&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47187&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47187/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47187&quot;&gt;#47187&lt;/a&gt;), and gained FP8 MoE support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4751229783&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46820&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46820/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46820&quot;&gt;#46820&lt;/a&gt;), CUDA graph + embed scaling fixes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4838798886&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48010&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48010/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48010&quot;&gt;#48010&lt;/a&gt;), and migration of GPTBigCode/Starcoder2 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;3743255279&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/30966&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/30966/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/30966&quot;&gt;#30966&lt;/a&gt;) and RoBERTa (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4796084774&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47452&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47452/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47452&quot;&gt;#47452&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New models&lt;/strong&gt;: LLaVA-OneVision-2 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4607171564&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44785&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44785/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44785&quot;&gt;#44785&lt;/a&gt;), Unlimited OCR (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4731183347&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46564&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46564/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46564&quot;&gt;#46564&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4773291378&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47102&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47102/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47102&quot;&gt;#47102&lt;/a&gt;), MOSS-Transcribe-Diarize (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4818458120&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47729&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47729/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47729&quot;&gt;#47729&lt;/a&gt;), openai/privacy-filter (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4336949551&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/41026&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/41026/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/41026&quot;&gt;#41026&lt;/a&gt;), and Hy3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4779360183&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47192&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47192/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47192&quot;&gt;#47192&lt;/a&gt;). GLM-5 / DeepSeek-V3.2 landed in the model zoo (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4750419018&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46808&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46808/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46808&quot;&gt;#46808&lt;/a&gt;) with GLM-5.2 tuning, and MiniMax-M3 gained pipeline parallelism (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4673787019&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45810&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45810/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45810&quot;&gt;#45810&lt;/a&gt;) and NVFP4 support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4746446884&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46756&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46756/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46756&quot;&gt;#46756&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Streaming Parser Engine&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4734469631&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46610&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46610/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46610&quot;&gt;#46610&lt;/a&gt;) — a unified tool-call/reasoning parsing framework, with a new Kimi k2.5/k2.6/k2.7 parser and ports of seed_oss (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4712323290&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46314&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46314/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46314&quot;&gt;#46314&lt;/a&gt;) and DeepSeek V4 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4679037164&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45877&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45877/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45877&quot;&gt;#45877&lt;/a&gt;). The Rust frontend continues to mature with HTTPS/mTLS (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4679969897&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45890&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45890/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45890&quot;&gt;#45890&lt;/a&gt;), a DP supervisor (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4771594184&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47076&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47076/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47076&quot;&gt;#47076&lt;/a&gt;), and profiler control routes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4712073684&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46306&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46306/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46306&quot;&gt;#46306&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Universal speculative decoding for heterogeneous vocabularies (TLI)&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4139881146&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/38174&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/38174/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/38174&quot;&gt;#38174&lt;/a&gt;), plus new DSpark (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4765241066&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46995&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46995/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46995&quot;&gt;#46995&lt;/a&gt;) and DFlash (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4747467380&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46770&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46770/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46770&quot;&gt;#46770&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4754205337&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46853&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46853/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46853&quot;&gt;#46853&lt;/a&gt;) drafters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Model Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
